# Internal notebook — not for the repo
NOTEBOOK.md

# --- Open-core boundary (decision D6) ----------------------------------------
# Three things never enter the public repo. Two modules:
#   delivery  render + export
#   beat      beat detection, beat map, cut-to-beat, auto-layer
# ...and the handcrafted preset packs, further down.
# Each module's public interface (src/<mod>/include) IS tracked so the public
# build compiles and links against a stub. Only the implementations are withheld.
src/delivery/private/
src/beat/private/

# The handcrafted preset packs that ship with the paid app. Commercial content,
# not code, built by hand in a separate project. The effects they are built ON
# are public — see src/effects — because a preset is worthless if the effect
# underneath it is missing (Pillar 1). Only the authored packs are withheld.
content/packs/
assets/packs/
presets/packs/

# Signing keys, license material, release credentials.
secrets/
private/
